      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1639957044687938589, guid: 930200d31832db5418ed4bf2e62f7424, type: 3}
      propertyPath: description
      value: The Intake Runner, located at the middle-center-front of the engine,
        is a medium-sized, elongated, accent-yellow component that plays a crucial
        role in directing air into the engine's combustion chamber. Its shape and
        position allow for optimal airflow, which is essential for efficient engine
        performance. Interestingly, the Intake Runner's accent-yellow color helps
        to distinguish it from other components during maintenance and inspection.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
